    {
      "id": "3qsqcq30",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 368,
      "width": 524,
      "height": 224,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e0f2fe",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PUSH-TO-TALK FLOW (web UI)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1. User holds \ud83c\udfa4 button (mousedown)\n2. getUserMedia \u2192 Web Audio ScriptProcessor captures PCM\n3. User releases button (mouseup)\n4. Browser: resampleLinear(pcm, srcRate, 16000)\n            encodeWAV(samples) \u2192 ArrayBuffer\n5. POST /api/transcribe  Content-Type: audio/wav\n6. Server: spawn_blocking \u2192 whisper-cli tempfile\n7. Server: read .txt output \u2192 { 'text': '...' }\n8. Browser: insert transcript into answer textarea",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "flsehuds",
      "originalText": "PUSH-TO-TALK FLOW (web UI)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1. User holds \ud83c\udfa4 button (mousedown)\n2. getUserMedia \u2192 Web Audio ScriptProcessor captures PCM\n3. User releases button (mouseup)\n4. Browser: resampleLinear(pcm, srcRate, 16000)\n            encodeWAV(samples) \u2192 ArrayBuffer\n5. POST /api/transcribe  Content-Type: audio/wav\n6. Server: spawn_blocking \u2192 whisper-cli tempfile\n7. Server: read .txt output \u2192 { 'text': '...' }\n8. Browser: insert transcript into answer textarea",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
