      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION \u2014 open questions:\n\n\u2022 Should there be a rocky voice test command\n  to verify end-to-end setup?\n\n\u2022 Should whisper model be configurable?\n  tiny vs base vs small (speed vs accuracy)\n\n\u2022 Should browser TTS be wired up for reading\n  questions aloud? (tts = 'browser' config key)\n\n\u2022 Push-to-hold vs push-to-toggle \u2014 which is better\n  UX for long answers?\n\n\u2022 Should the mic button show a live waveform?\n\n\u2022 CLI hands-free mode (rocky quiz --voice):\n  needs cpal + webrtc-vad \u2014 deferred from v0.2",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "o30ubmc9",
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udcdd ANNOTATION \u2014 open questions:\n\n\u2022 Should there be a rocky voice test command\n  to verify end-to-end setup?\n\n\u2022 Should whisper model be configurable?\n  tiny vs base vs small (speed vs accuracy)\n\n\u2022 Should browser TTS be wired up for reading\n  questions aloud? (tts = 'browser' config key)\n\n\u2022 Push-to-hold vs push-to-toggle \u2014 which is better\n  UX for long answers?\n\n\u2022 Should the mic button show a live waveform?\n\n\u2022 CLI hands-free mode (rocky quiz --voice):\n  needs cpal + webrtc-vad \u2014 deferred from v0.2",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
  ],
